    "detailed_description": "Jump into your ship and shoot asteroids and UFOs in this high speed classic 80's style space shooter<br>If you like addictive fast paced shooters and like to beat your high scores, then this is for YOU!<br><br><br>- 15 Levels of difficulty or time attack mode<br>- 3 Lives<br>- Shields<br>- Triple shot<br>- Increasing shoot speed<br>- Fuel pickups<br>- Ammo pickups<br>- High score board<br><br>Each time you level up your gun fires faster and faster but make sure it doesn\u2019t overheat!<br><br>On your last life, don\u2019t fear you may be lucky and an extra life pickup may appear, who knows<br>Just don't run out of fuel or ammo!<br><br><strong>Update</strong><br>Steam Deck playability<br>Set compatability to 'Proton Experimental'<br>Set control layout to 'Game Pad'<br>Controls:<br>R1 = Thruster<br>R2 = Shield<br>A = Fire<br>D-Pad for Left/Right rotate<br>Menu button to go back to main menu<br>Y = Pause<br>use touch screen for onscreen buttons/entering name<br><br><strong>An offical Steam Deck build is in the works!</strong>",
